<x-screen-instructions title="How to use Comp Reasons">
    <p>The pick-list a Manager+ chooses from when waiving someone's entry fee at check-in, or when resolving a Showrunner's freeform comp request.</p>
    <p>Set a dollar amount on <strong>Grants voucher amount</strong> if a comp for this reason should automatically hand the member a voucher once the event ends and they've actually shown up (e.g. a comped presenter). Leave it blank for a reason that's just a waived fee and nothing more.</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
